Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:54.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,我以为在这个星球上是禁止使用武器的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought weapons were forbidden on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.13,0:02:02.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,再说了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.51,0:02:08.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,...我不相信你会为了这片荒地而把我杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..I can't believe you'd kill me for a field of empty holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.23,0:02:13.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是我唯一拥有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.93,0:02:41.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的内心非常痛苦  关于我的痛苦你知道些什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your pain runs deep. What do you know of my pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.52,0:02:45.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我们...  一起来探索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us explore it...together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.90,0:02:49.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,每个人心中都隐藏着一种神秘的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each man hides a secret pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.28,0:02:53.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须揭开它的面纱  正视它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must be exposed and reckoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.49,0:02:58.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须把它从黑暗拽进光明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must be dragged from the darkness into the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.33,0:03:02.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,分享你的痛苦  让我分享你的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Share your pain. Share your pain with me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:06.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,并从分享之中获得力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and gain strength from the sharing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.03,0:03:27.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪里获得这种能力的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you get this power?.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.87,0:03:34.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,这种能力就在你心中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The power was within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.09,0:03:43.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉如释重负\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is as if a weight has been lifted from my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.35,0:03:48.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可以怎么报答你?  加入我的探寻之旅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can I repay you? Join my quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.35,0:03:53.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在探寻什么?  就是你所探寻的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it you seek?. What you seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:04:01.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,自从世界起源以来人们一直在探寻的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What all men have sought since time began.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.50,0:04:05.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,终极的学识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ultimate knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.83,0:04:09.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要一艘星舰才能去探寻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To find it we need a starship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.84,0:04:14.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,星舰?  祥云III星球上没有星舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A starship? There are no starships on Nimbus Ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.39,0:04:18.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,我有办法弄一艘来  什么办法?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a way to bring one here. But how?.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.48,0:04:24.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,要有信心  我的朋友  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have faith, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:27.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们有很多人  比你知道的多得多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are more of us than you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.44,0:04:30.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是个瓦肯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a Vulcan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.07,0:05:13.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,《星际迷航5:终极先锋》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.20,0:06:22.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,(约塞米蒂国家公园  地球)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.67,0:06:28.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,(星历8454.1)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:03.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,你会在登陆假期中玩得很愉快的  老骨头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'You'll have a great time on shore leave, Bones."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.21,0:09:06.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,你可以好好放松放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'You'll be able to relax."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.75,0:09:12.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,你把这叫做放松?  我紧张得要命呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call this relaxing? I'm a nervous wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.84,0:09:16.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果不注意点  我可能会疯掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I'm not careful, I'll end up talking to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.32,0:09:33.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greetings, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.04,0:09:40.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克  你在这儿干嘛?  我在监视你的进展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, what are you doing here? I'm monitoring your progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.29,0:09:41.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,我真是受宠若惊 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm flattered,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.36,0:09:43.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,但公园里有这么多有趣的景点  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} but of all the points of interest here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:45.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么偏偏到我这儿来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why pick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.26,0:09:51.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,埃尔卡普坦峰的攀登纪录是无人能破的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The record for climbing EI Capitan is in no danger of being broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.52,0:09:55.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,我这么做是因为我喜欢爬山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm doing this because I enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.81,0:10:00.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,更不用说最重要的原因...  什么原因?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to mention the most important reason for climbing a mountain...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.86,0:10:04.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为山在你面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.16,0:10:08.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不认为你意识到了自己现在有多危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not think you realise the gravity of your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:16.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,恰恰相反  危险性是我最关心的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the contrary, gravity is foremost on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.46,0:10:21.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要继续往上爬了  你去找麦考依医生唠叨吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to make an ascent. Go pester Dr McCoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.51,0:10:26.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,麦考依医生现在心情不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr McCoy is not in the best of moods.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.77,0:10:30.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,不负责任的混蛋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn irresponsible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.07,0:10:34.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,简直是玩命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Playing games with life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:38.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,一定要集中精力  你必须人石合一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Concentration is vital. You must be one with the rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:42.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你继续烦我的话...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't stop distracting me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.11,0:11:11.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,也许山在你面前这个爬山理由并不充分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps "because it is there" is not sufficient reason to climb a mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.53,0:11:14.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不得不同意你的说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am hardly in a position to disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.12,0:11:18.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,嗨  老骨头  一起吃晚饭吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Bones. Mind if we drop in for dinner?.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.84,0:11:29.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,(祥云III星球  天堂城)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.88,0:12:26.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,先生们  我叫凯瑟琳·达尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Caithlin Dar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.63,0:12:32.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,对!  罗幕兰的新代表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Our new Romulan representative.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:39.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到天堂城  银河和平之星的首都\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Paradise City, capital of the Planet of Galactic Peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.56,0:12:43.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是圣约翰·陶博特  祥云III星球的联邦代表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm St John Talbot, the Federation Representative here on Nimbus Ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.98,0:12:48.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的这位富有魅力的伙伴是克林贡领事  考德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My charming companion is the Klingon Consul, Korrd.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.33,0:12:56.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,我猜这就是克林贡人打招呼的方式  请进  亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I expect that's Klingon for hello. Come in, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.94,0:13:18.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,20年前  我们三族政府共同商定开发这个星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}20 years ago, our three governments agreed to develop this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.70,0:13:25.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个新时代由此诞生了  但很快就结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A new age was born. It died a quick death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:31.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,被我们骗到这里的移民很快变得好斗起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The settlers we conned into coming here took to fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:35.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们没收了他们的武器  但他们却开始自行制造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We forbad them weapons, but they fashioned their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.59,0:13:38.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,看来我来得正是时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears I've arrived just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:41.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,离那发报机远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from that transmitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.93,0:14:49.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗幕兰人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Romulan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:53.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,地球人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terran.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.81,0:14:56.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,克林贡人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Klingon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.02,0:15:01.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们已成为我的俘虏  俘虏?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider yourselves my prisoners. Prisoners?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.53,0:15:05.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们早已成为这片荒土的俘虏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're already prisoners here on this worthless lump of rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.16,0:15:10.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们对你有什么价值?  祥云III星球是一片荒土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What value could we be to you? Nimbus Ill is a worthless lump of rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.00,0:15:17.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,但整个银河系也只有这地方  会同时出现你们三个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it is the only place in the galaxy that has the three of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.26,0:15:23.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的政府会不惜一切代价保护我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our governments will stop at nothing to ensure our safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:26.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,这正是我所期望的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly what I'm counting on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.12,0:15:40.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,USS  进取号试航报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}USS Enterprise, shakedown cruise report.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:44.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想这船是猴子们组装起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think this new ship was put togetherbymonkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:51.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,有半数的门开不了  猜猜谁来做修理工作?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halfthe doors won't open, and guess whosejob itis to make itright?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.47,0:15:54.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Borgus frat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.39,0:15:58.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我们看看她有些什么能耐  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Let's see what she's got,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.26,0:16:00.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,史考提  我们都看到了  对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Scotty." We found out, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.65,0:16:03.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你一定能把她驯服的  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you'll whip her into shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.25,0:16:05.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,乌拉我以为你休假去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Uhura, I thought you were on leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.36,0:16:08.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们应该一起去休假的  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we were going together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.39,0:16:12.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,进取号需要我的时候我是不会离开她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} I can't leave her when she needs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:16.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你会这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a feeling you would say something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.67,0:16:19.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以我把晚餐带来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I brought us dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:24.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是我认识的最善解人意的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the most understanding woman I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.85,0:16:28.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,红色警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:32.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,我刚修好那该死的东西!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just fixed that damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:36.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,关掉它  行吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn it off, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:38.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,红色警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.45,0:16:43.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是红色警报  进取号  收到请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a red alert. Enterprise, acknowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:49.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,这里是进取号  请说明你的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Enterprise. Identify yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.54,0:16:56.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,这里是星际舰队  在中立区出现7级优先情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Starfleet. We have a Priority 7 situation in the NeutraIZone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:59.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,史考提  这是来真的  不会吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty, this is for real. They can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:04.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,这船现在七零八落的而且主要船员也没到齐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship's in pieces and we've got less than a skeleton crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.64,0:17:08.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,星际舰队  知道我们当前的状况吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starfleet, are you aware of our current status?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:14.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,知道  准备接收行动命令并召回主要船员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Stand by to copy operational orders and recall key personnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.45,0:17:20.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,承认吧  我们迷路了  对  但我们仍在加速前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admit it, we're lost. Yes, but we're making good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:26.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,苏鲁中校  请回答  真难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander Sulu, come in. I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.84,0:17:29.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,登陆假期取消了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shore leave is cancelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.30,0:17:34.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,咱终于有救了  返回预定位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rescued at last. Return to pre-arranged co-ordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.47,0:17:40.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不能说我们迷路了  有问题吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't say we're lost. Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.27,0:17:46.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,对  我们遇到了...  一场暴风雪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. We've been caught in...a blizzard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.66,0:17:54.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们什么也看不见  请给我们指明方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't see a thing. Direct us to the co-ordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.37,0:17:59.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,我这里显示天气晴朗  气温华氏70度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My visual says sunny skies and 70 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.92,0:18:06.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,苏鲁看  太阳出来了  真是奇迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, the sun has come out. It's a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.68,0:18:10.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,别担心  我会保守你们这个秘密的  我会用穿梭机接你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, your secretis safe with me. I'll send the shuttle foryou.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:13.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,乌拉  我欠你一个人情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uhura, I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.40,0:18:17.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,快过来吃吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come and get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.07,0:18:20.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,老骨头  快别敲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones, knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.07,0:18:24.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们就在这儿而且饿死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're right here and we're starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.70,0:18:27.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,彼泼德种子  医生?  豆子 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bipodal seeds, Doctor?.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.09,0:18:29.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克  但不是普通豆子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beans, Spock, but no ordinary beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.42,0:18:33.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是根据我父亲传给我的一个  古老食谱做出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are from an old recipe handed down to me by my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.01,0:18:36.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你把你的瓦肯鼻子贴着这些...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you stick your Vulcan nose up at these,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.05,0:18:41.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,你真是麦考依家族中出言不逊的一代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're insulting generations of McCoys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.72,0:18:45.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,这样的话我只好尝尝你的豆子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In that case I have little choice but to sample your beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:58.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,真是不错  它的确有一种我不熟悉的配料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surprisingly good. It does have a flavouring I'm not familiar with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.04,0:19:04.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,那可是秘密配料  还有其他秘密配料吗  老骨头?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the secret ingredient. Any more secret ingredient, Bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:08.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,请自便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.51,0:19:15.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的秘密配料就是酒?  威士忌  田纳西威士忌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your secret ingredient is alcohol? Tennessee whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.35,0:19:19.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,威士忌和豆子  真是劲爆组合  史波克能搞定它吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bourbon and beans, an explosive combination. Can Spock handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.73,0:19:23.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,你开玩笑  以瓦肯人的新陈代谢能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With that Vulcan metabolism,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.78,0:19:26.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,一碗白蚁他也吃得下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} he could eat a bowl of termites.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.41,0:19:33.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,医生  我一半是人类  根本看不出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor, I am half-human. It certainly doesn't show.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.04,0:19:36.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢  这家伙总是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. This guy never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:40.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,我取笑他  他却以为我在赞美他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I insult him and he takes it as a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.47,0:19:48.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个真令人头疼  我怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two could drive a man to drink. What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.23,0:19:56.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,人的生命是那么宝贵  怎么可以那么疯狂地冒险呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Human life is far too precious to risk on crazy stunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.57,0:20:02.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,你从那山上摔下来时会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have been killed when you fell off that mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.28,0:20:05.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,我确实想过这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It did cross my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.37,0:20:08.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,但我知道即使摔下来我也不会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But even as I fell I knew I wouldn't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.67,0:20:14.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是只有他才是永生的吗?  不  不是说这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't he the only one who's immortal? No, it isn't that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:19.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道自己不会死是因为我有你们两个相伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew I wouldn't die because the two of you were with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.47,0:20:23.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白  我一直都知道...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not understand. I've always known...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.52,0:20:28.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,...我会孤独地死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..l'll die alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.49,0:20:36.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会在瓦尔哈拉殿堂给你订个房间的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll call Valhalla and reserve a room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.58,0:20:47.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,到时候我们一起在太空  不断地相互打趣...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that time in space, getting on each others nerves...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.63,0:20:53.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么登陆假期时我们干什么呢?  我们一起度假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what do we do on shore leave? We spend it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.06,0:20:59.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,其他人都有家庭  其他人  我们没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other people have families. Other people, not us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.95,0:21:08.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.74,0:21:12.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,我准备烤一个沼泽甜瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm preparing to toast a "marsh melon".
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.75,0:21:19.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,真有你的!  沼泽甜瓜  你哪里学来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be damned! A marsh melon. Where did you learn to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.42,0:21:26.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,我了解过野营方面的一些习俗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have familiarised myself with the customs associated with camping out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.72,0:21:33.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们烤完沼泽甜瓜之后干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we do after we toast the marsh melon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.65,0:21:38.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,吃掉它们  不  我是说在那以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We consume them. No, I mean after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.45,0:21:45.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该进行一个叫作大伙齐欢唱的仪式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are required to engage in a ritual known as the sing-along.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.58,0:21:47.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,自从我还是个爱荷华州的小男孩以来  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't sung around the campfire
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.81,0:21:49.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,一直没有再绕着篝火唱过歌了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since I was a boy in lowa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.67,0:21:52.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们唱什么呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we going to sing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.55,0:21:55.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,康城赛马  收拾起你的烦恼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Camptown Races." "Pack up your troubles."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.76,0:21:58.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们要走了吗?  这是一首歌的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we leaving? It's a song title.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:22:02.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,莱久7星球上的月亮  划呀划  来划船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Moon over Rigel 7." "Row, row, row your boat."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.19,0:22:09.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道《划呀划  来划船》吗?  我没研究过它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know "Row your boat"? It didn't come up in my research.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.57,0:22:11.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,歌词很简单...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lyrics are very simple...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.24,0:22:15.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,划呀划  来划船  缓缓地顺流而下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Row, row, row your boat gently down the stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.62,0:22:18.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,欢快地  欢快地  欢快地  欢快地划 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Merrily, merrily, merrily, merrily,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.68,0:22:19.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,人生只是一场梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}life is but a dream."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.16,0:22:24.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,医生和我先唱  然后你加入进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Doctor and I will start off and you jump in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.88,0:22:31.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,医生  你先请  别说我没警告过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor, if you please. Don't say I didn't warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.36,0:22:52.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克  你为什么不加入进来?  我不理解歌词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, why didn't you jump in? I cannot comprehend the words.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.00,0:22:58.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,这只是首歌  你这个绿血的瓦肯人  歌词并不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a song, you green-blooded Vulcan. The words aren't important.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.05,0:23:04.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,你只要唱得高兴就够了  对不起  医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just have a good time singing. I am sorry, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.85,0:23:10.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们唱歌的时候很高兴吗?  我比较喜欢死而复生之前的他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were we having a good time? I liked him better before he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.85,0:23:14.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们还是睡觉吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.58,0:23:28.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长...  我们在休假  叫我吉姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain... We're on leave. Call me Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.83,0:23:31.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,吉姆...  什么事  史波克?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim... Yes, Spock?.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.34,0:23:34.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,人生不是一场梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life is not a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.09,0:23:39.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,睡觉吧  史波克  是  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to sleep, Spock. Yes, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.68,0:23:44.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,晚安  老骨头  晚安  吉姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, Bones. Good night, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.60,0:23:49.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,晚安  史波克  晚安  医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, Spock. Good night, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.40,0:23:53.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,晚安  史波克  晚安  吉姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, Spock. Good night, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.45,0:23:58.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白  我就是不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I just don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.57,0:24:24.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,卡拉舰长  发现一个古老的深空探测卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Klaa, we have the target in sight. A probe ofancient origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.40,0:24:27.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,很难摧毁吗?  很难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Difflcult to hit? Most difflcult.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.82,0:24:31.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,好  所有武器由我控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. All weapons atmy control.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.91,0:24:33.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,观察镜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scope.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.24,0:25:04.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,射击太空垃圾不足以考验战士的勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shooting space garbage is no test ofa warrior's mettle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.87,0:25:08.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,我需要一个会还击的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a target thatfilghts back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.71,0:25:12.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长  收到新资料  祥云III星球有人被劫持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, new data, hostages on Nimbus Ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.60,0:25:21.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,其中一个是克林贡人  其他的呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One ofthe hostages is a Klingon. And the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.93,0:25:25.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个地球人和一个罗幕兰人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Terran and a Romulan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.40,0:25:31.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,联邦一定会派出星舰营救他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Federation will be sending a rescue ship ofits own.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.41,0:25:35.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,设定航线前往祥云III星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plot course forNimbus Ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.12,0:25:41.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,我一直想跟联邦星舰交手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always wanted to engage a Federation ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.30,0:25:49.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,那该死的光别照我脸上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the damn light out of my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.19,0:26:03.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能用穿梭机过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had to send the shuttlecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.99,0:26:06.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,传送机还无法运作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The transporter is non-operational.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.16,0:26:12.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们收到了新命令  我带着通讯器呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have received new orders. I had my communicator.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.96,0:26:16.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,你忘带了  真不知道我怎么会忘的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You forgot to take it with you. I wonder why I did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.34,0:26:23.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,看来登陆假期取消了  收拾下垃圾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears shore leave has been cancelled. Pack out your trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.09,0:26:59.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只渴望要一艘高大的船  以及一颗引航的星星相伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"All I ask is a tall ship and a star to steer her by."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.06,0:27:03.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,麦尔维尔  约翰·梅斯菲尔德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Melville. John Masefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.94,0:27:08.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,你确定?  我十分精通经典作品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure about that? I'm well-versed in the classics.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.11,0:27:13.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,那你怎么会不知道《划呀划  来划船》?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then how come you don't know "Row, row, row your boat"?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.00,0:27:27.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,进取号  下面由你控制  我们干得不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enterprise, you have control. We're doing just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.80,0:28:07.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只想说  他们不像以前那样造船了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I can say is they don't make them like they used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.39,0:28:11.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,你说过你能在两周内修好这艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me you could have this ship operational in two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.48,0:28:14.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想你给我的时间太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you gave me too much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.03,0:28:20.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,我得跟你们说多少次?  要合适的工具才能干好相应的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many times do I have to tell you? The right tool for the right job.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.58,0:28:23.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,我从没见他这么高兴过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen him happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.16,0:28:27.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰桥...但愿能到达舰桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bridge...l hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.22,0:28:37.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要先去淋浴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could use a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.60,0:28:39.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.40,0:28:46.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,这船上没一样东西能正常工作的吗? \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't anything work on this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.74,0:28:49.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们不能叫我们这样去执行任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can't send us out like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.49,0:28:55.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,星际舰队通讯当前在线  接到屏幕上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starfleet transmission on line. Put it on the view screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.04,0:29:01.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,请稍微安静点行吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we have a little quiet, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.59,0:29:10.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,能调清楚点吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you clear that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.77,0:29:16.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,能不能稍微安静点?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we have a little quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.40,0:29:19.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,鲍勃!  吉姆!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob! Jim!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.40,0:29:24.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么制服都没穿?  我正要去淋浴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are dressing informally. I'm on my way to the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.82,0:29:27.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉取消了你们的登陆假期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I apologise for cancelling shore leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.45,0:29:32.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,在祥云III星出现危急情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a dangerous situation out on Nimbus III.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.33,0:29:35.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,银河和平之星上?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the Planet of Galactic Peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.46,0:29:40.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,一伙恐怖分子占领了唯一的居住区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A terroristforce has captured the only settlement.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.68,0:29:45.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们抓了人质  克林贡  罗幕兰和联邦的三位领事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've taken hostages. The Klingon, the Romulan, the Federation Consuls.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.35,0:29:52.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,进取号还无法胜任...  进取号简直是在灾难中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Enterprise is not up to specs... The Enterprise is a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.82,0:29:57.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这象限中还有其他星舰  但是没有经验丰富的指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have ships in the quadrant. Butno experienced commanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.66,0:30:00.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,我需要吉姆·柯克  拜托!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need Jim Kirk. Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.03,0:30:05.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,去祥云III星并评估那里的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proceed to Nimbus Ill and assess the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.29,0:30:07.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,避免冲突\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Avoid a confrontation.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.09,0:30:11.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,但最重要的是  把那些人质安全地救回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Above all, however, get those hostages back safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.22,0:30:15.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,克林贡人有回应吗?  没有  但肯定会有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have the Klingons responded? No, butyou can bet they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.64,0:30:23.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,设定航线前往祥云III  苏鲁先生  航线设定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plot a course for Nimbus Ill, Mr Sulu. Course plotted.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.69,0:30:27.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,我恐怕这艘船的毛病得在路上解决了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid the ship's problems will have to be solved en route.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.32,0:30:32.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你们每个人都尽力而为  我们开始干活吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm counting on each one of you to give his best. Let's go to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.87,0:30:37.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,吉姆  如果你问我  而你还没...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim, if you ask me, and you haven't...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.58,0:30:41.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这不是个好主意  我们肯定会碰上克林贡人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think this is a terrible idea. We're bound to bump into the Klingons.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.67,0:30:46.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,而且他们真的不怎么喜欢你  彼此彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they don't exactly like you. The feeling's mutual.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.30,0:30:50.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,轮机舱  我们需要你能提供的全部动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engine room, we'll need all the power you can muster, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.97,0:30:52.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,就算我只能用双手推船 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll beat those Klingon devils
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.90,0:30:55.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们也一定能打败那些克林贡魔鬼的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} even if I have to get out and push.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.15,0:30:58.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,我希望不要惨到那个样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope it won't come to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.19,0:31:02.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,尽可能以最快速度航行  苏鲁先生  是  长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All possible speed, Mr Sulu. Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.74,0:31:12.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?  我怀念起我的旧椅子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter?. I miss my old chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.51,0:31:25.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,进取号奉命前往祥云III星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The starship Enterprise has been dispatched to Nimbus Ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.35,0:31:30.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,进取号?  那是柯克的星舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enterprise? That's Kirk's ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.82,0:31:38.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果我能打败柯克...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ifl could defeatKirk...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.41,0:31:43.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,那你就是全银河最英勇的战士了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would be the greatest warrior in the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.29,0:31:48.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,全速前进  我们必胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maximum speed! Success!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.71,0:31:54.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长日志:  星历84...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain's log: Stardate 84...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.36,0:31:56.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,(系统故障)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.27,0:32:01.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长日志:  星历84...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain's log: Stardate 84...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.98,0:32:07.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,早上好  舰长  算了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Captain. Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.74,0:32:13.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们获得了有关人质的信息  显示到屏幕上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have the hostage information. Put it on the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.49,0:32:20.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是星际舰队资料库授权传输的资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is an authorised transmission from the Starfleetmemorybank.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.34,0:32:27.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么是考德将军!  显然他已不再受宠了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not General Korrd! He's apparently fallen from favour.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.01,0:32:32.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,考德的军事战略曾是学院的必修课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Korrd's military strategies were required learning at the Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.94,0:32:37.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,等他们逼我退休的时候  希望我下场能比他好点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When they put me out to pasture, I hope I fair better than Korrd.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.44,0:32:43.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,这一定是人质的录像了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This must be the hostage tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.78,0:32:49.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,不久前我们向银河光明之军投降了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A short time ago, we surrendered to the Galactic Army ofLight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.04,0:32:54.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在处在他们首领的保护性监禁之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are now in the protective custody oftheir leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.59,0:33:00.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,只要我们合作就不会受到伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will be treated humanely as long as we cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.80,0:33:05.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,他要求你们立即派出一艘星舰来谈判释放我们的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He requests thatyou send a starship to parley for our release at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.98,0:33:10.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在很好  如果你们能迅速作出答复我们将很感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are in good health and would appreciate your immediate response.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.07,0:33:17.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很遗憾做出这样极端的事  但这是极端的时期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I regret this desperate act, but these are desperate times.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.86,0:33:22.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,我无意伤害这些无辜者  但是不要考验我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean no harm to these innocents, but do notputme to the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.79,0:33:27.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,我恳求你们立即回应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I implore you to respond immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.31,0:33:43.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.81,0:33:49.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来像见了鬼似的  也许是的  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like you've seen a ghost. Perhaps I have, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.52,0:34:19.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克  怎么了?  你认识这个瓦肯人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, what is it? Do you know this Vulcan?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.86,0:34:23.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不确定  但他确实很眼熟?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot be certain. But he does seem familiar?.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.61,0:34:27.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,他使我想起了我年轻的时候认识的一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He reminds me of someone I knew in my youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.45,0:34:33.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,我没听你说过  我不常回忆过去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know you had one. I do not often think of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.38,0:34:39.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,他使你想起了谁?  一个才华横溢的年轻学生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who does he remind you of? A gifted young student.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.59,0:34:43.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,他很有智慧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He possessed a great intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.68,0:34:50.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,他曾被认为能够成为伟大瓦肯学者团体中的一员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was assumed that he would join the great scholars of Vulcan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.90,0:34:54.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,但他是个变革者  这是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he was a revolutionary. What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.36,0:34:58.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,他所寻求的学识是被瓦肯信仰所禁止的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The knowledge he sought was forbidden by Vulcan belief.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.24,0:35:04.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,禁止?  他拒绝培养逻辑思维\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forbidden? He rejected his logical upbringing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.29,0:35:07.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,他信奉我们祖先那种野性的激情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He embraced the animal passions of our ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.21,0:35:16.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,他相信自我认识的关键在于情感...  而不是逻辑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He believed the key to self-knowledge was emotion...not logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.56,0:35:19.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,想想看  一个充满激情的瓦肯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine that, a passionate Vulcan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.19,0:35:25.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,当他开始鼓励其他人跟随他时  他被驱逐出瓦肯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he encouraged others to follow him, he was banished from Vulcan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.48,0:35:27.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,真有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.03,0:35:31.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长到舰桥来  我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain to the bridge. On my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.33,0:35:40.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克?  来了  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock?. Coming, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.18,0:35:52.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,正在靠近祥云III星球  标准轨道  苏鲁先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Approaching Nimbus Ill. Standard orbit, Mr Sulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.06,0:35:59.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,天堂城要求我们表明来意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paradise City is demanding to know our intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.65,0:36:03.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,用静电噪音回复  让他们以为我们正遇到麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Respond with static. Let them think we're having difficulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.11,0:36:09.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,天堂城  我们难以接收清楚你们的讯息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paradise City, we are barely receiving your transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.41,0:36:16.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,传送室  报告情况  传送机还无法使用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transporter room, status. Transporter is still inoperative.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.42,0:36:21.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,就算我们锁定了人质也无法把他们传送上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we could lock on to the hostages, we couldn't beam them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.85,0:36:27.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,看来我们得自己去救他们了  克林贡战舰正在接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll have to get them out ourselves. Klingon vessel approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.90,0:36:31.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,猛禽舰  1.9小时后她的武器进入射程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bird of Prey. 1 .9 hours till her weapons are in range.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.44,0:36:35.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,该死!  我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.85,0:36:57.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们的扫描设备很简陋  但很有效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their scanning equipment is primitive, but effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.14,0:37:03.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,在坐标856.3登陆  那儿离城市很远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Land at co-ordinate 856.3. That's far from the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.27,0:37:08.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能冒险被侦查到  苏鲁先生  执行命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot risk detection. Mr Sulu, execute.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.16,0:37:19.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,这里是进取号星舰  联邦星舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the starship Enterprise. A Federation starship.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.59,0:37:29.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是帕维尔·契可夫舰长  你们违反了我们的协定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Captain Pavel Chekov. You are in violation ofour treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.39,0:37:33.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,立即释放人质否则将遭受严重后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release your hostages at once orsuffer the consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.39,0:37:37.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的威胁真好笑  什么后果?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your threats amuse me. What consequences?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.68,0:38:05.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,一艘克林贡战舰将在一小时内来到这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Klingon warship will arrive within the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.77,0:38:11.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,克林贡人会十分生气  他们可能会摧毁这个星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Klingons will be quite angry. They are likely to destroy the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.36,0:38:15.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么我能受你和你的飞船保护真是太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it is fortunate I have you and your starship to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.70,0:38:21.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,你和你的大副传送到我指定的坐标上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and your first officer are to beam down to my co-ordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.96,0:38:28.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们很乐意传送下来  但我们必须能得到保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will be happy to beam down, but we musthave certain assurances.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.22,0:38:34.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,步行到城市需要1.2小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At foot speed, the journey to the city will take 1 .2 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.14,0:38:37.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有1.2小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have 1.2 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.73,0:38:44.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,等等...好极了!  我们得引起他们的注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute... Perfect! We'll have to get their attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.92,0:39:03.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.06,0:39:11.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,她是不是裸着身子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she naked?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.03,0:39:53.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好  小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.65,0:39:58.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我一直希望能以歌声俘获人心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always wanted to play to a captive audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.79,0:40:10.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克  要人马合一  是  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, be one with the horse. Yes, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.60,0:40:18.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,打开门  是我们的侦查队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the gate. It's our lookout party.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.60,0:40:24.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,联邦士兵就在我们后面  关上门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Federation soldiers are right behind us. Close the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.62,0:40:35.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们要去哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they going?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.92,0:40:39.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克...  停下你的马  我在做扫描\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock... Hold your horse, I'm scanning.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.97,0:40:49.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,人质在那座建筑物里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hostages are being held in that structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.19,0:40:55.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,加里利奥  开始行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Galileo, start your run.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.28,0:41:01.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,相位枪设定为击晕  苏鲁  打掉那灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phasers on stun. Sulu, take out that light.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.59,0:41:21.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?  投降  你们正遭受攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on? Surrender, you are under attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.01,0:41:26.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我并不想要流血冲突  等等!  回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't bloodshed I wanted. Wait! Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.95,0:42:15.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,乌拉  快下来  收到  来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uhura, come on down. Roger, coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.14,0:43:05.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,祥云III以其野生动物而闻名 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nimbus Ill is famous forits wildllfe,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.17,0:43:07.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,这里也是最棒的钓鱼之处!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the flshing is terrifilc!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.06,0:43:11.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,你可以很方便地在联邦政府资助下到达那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy flnancing through Federation Federal can take you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.86,0:43:15.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地  请合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God. Please cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.24,0:43:18.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,交出你们的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hand over your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.12,0:43:25.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,干得好  我的朋友们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.59,0:44:04.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Qualse tu?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.51,0:44:08.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.90,0:44:20.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克  是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.20,0:44:26.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是赛波克  你终于找到我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Sybok. You've finally caught up with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.12,0:44:31.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,难道你没什么要对我说的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you have anything to say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.84,0:44:40.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,你因违反17项中立区协定而被捕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are under arrest for 17 violations of the Neutral Zone Treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.99,0:44:56.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克!  你终于有了点幽默感  我没和你开玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've developed a sense of humour. I did not intend to amuse you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.20,0:45:03.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,这些是很严肃的指控  但如果你现在投降...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are serious charges. However, if you surrender now...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.96,0:45:10.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,对不起  史波克  我还没违反全部的中立区协定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Spock, I'm not through violating the Neutral Zone Treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.09,0:45:16.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,事实上  我才刚刚开始  我接下来要违反的是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, I'm just getting started. For my next violation,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.81,0:45:20.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,我准备偷一样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I intend to steal something.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.65,0:45:23.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,一样非常大的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something very big.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.40,0:45:28.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要你的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your starship.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.70,0:45:32.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,你设计这一切就是为了偷到我的飞船?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You staged all this to get your hands on my ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.00,0:45:38.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁?  詹姆斯T.柯克舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you? Captain James T Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.25,0:45:44.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,我以为契可夫舰长...  我明白了...很聪明  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought Captain Chekov... I see... Very clever, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.81,0:45:52.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克  再给你一次加入我的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, you have been given a second chance to join me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.73,0:45:58.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是一名星际舰队军官  当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a Starfleet officer. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.61,0:46:05.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,当然  那么我就不用你们帮忙  自己偷船了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. Then I'll take the ship without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.02,0:46:28.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,穿梭机正在返回  猛禽舰的位置?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shuttle en route. Position of Bird of Prey?.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.07,0:46:33.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,接近中!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Closing!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.87,0:46:43.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,距离射程还有约8000公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Estimating attack range in 8,000 kellicams.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.79,0:46:48.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们秘密行动  四分之一脉冲推进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stealth approach, slow to one quarterimpulse power.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.01,0:46:53.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,准备隐形  启动隐形装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare to cloak. Engage cloaking device.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.49,0:47:08.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,猛禽舰肯定隐形了  升起护盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Bird of Prey must have cloaked. Raise shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.20,0:47:12.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,穿梭机怎么办?  照做  进入红色警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The shuttle? Do it. Go to red alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.43,0:47:28.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,当我们控制你的船以后  我们就把追随者们带上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we control your vessel, we'll bring up our followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.52,0:47:32.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,克林贡人就在那儿  我们能赶到飞船上就很幸运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Klingons are out there. We'll be lucky to make it to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.65,0:47:35.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,这里是进取号  红色警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Enterprise, red alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.40,0:47:39.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,猛禽舰正在靠近  已升起护盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bird ofPrey approaching. Raising shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.53,0:47:42.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,找一个安全的港口降落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find a safe harbour.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.95,0:47:45.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.62,0:47:51.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要回复  保持航线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No reply. Remain on course.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.84,0:47:55.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,听我说  要让这艘小艇进入起降台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me. In order for this craft to enter the landing bay,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.22,0:48:00.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,进取号就必须降下护盾  并激活牵引光束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enterprise must lower the shields and activate the tractor beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.89,0:48:06.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,重新升起护盾要花...  15.5秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To re-raise the shields will take... 15.5 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.40,0:48:10.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这么长的时间里将非常脆弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An eternity, during which we'll be vulnerable to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.11,0:48:16.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,他说的是真话  如果我们的人隐形了  就表示要攻击了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He speaks the truth. If my people are cloaked, then they intend to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.50,0:48:23.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能回头  让我来做点什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot turn back. Let me do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.13,0:48:27.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  做你必须做的  别耍花招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well, do what you must, but no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.77,0:48:38.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,进取号  我是柯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enterprise, this is Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.81,0:48:44.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克  他在穿梭机上  快改变攻击航向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirk! He's on the shuttlecratf! Alter the attack course!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.36,0:48:49.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,了解你们的处境  但我们不能返回行星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understand your situation. Are unable to return to planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.62,0:48:55.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,准备执行紧急降落计划...B\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by to execute emergency landing plan...B
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.34,0:49:07.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,紧急降落计划B?  B  就是barricade中的B\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emergency landing plan B? B as in barricade.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.14,0:49:13.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.15,0:49:19.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,为了快速降下和升起护盾  我们不使用牵引光束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In order to lower and raise the shields quickly, we'll forego the tractor beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.32,0:49:22.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们将手动驾驶她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll fly her in manually.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.74,0:49:28.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你常这样做?  事实上  这是我第一次尝试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How often have you done this? Actually, it's my first attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.88,0:49:34.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,他很棒...真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's good...really.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.01,0:49:41.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,史考提  打开起降台大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty, open bay doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.78,0:49:52.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,准备解除隐形并开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by to de-cloak forflring.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.53,0:49:56.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,史考提  降下护盾  正在降下护盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty, lower shields. Lowering shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.80,0:50:10.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,猛禽舰方位105.2  前进  苏鲁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bird of Prey bearing 105.2. Go, Sulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.03,0:50:29.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们进来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.83,0:50:34.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准进取号  已瞄准目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bear on Enterprise. Enterprise targeted!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.29,0:50:37.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,进入曲速!  开火!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warp speed now! Firing!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.30,0:50:46.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,追踪他们的航线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Track her course!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.02,0:50:51.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,他果然了得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.99,0:51:35.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须立即改变航线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must change course at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.21,0:51:42.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,我带你去舰桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take you to the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.17,0:52:21.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,把枪捡起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.81,0:52:29.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,赛波克...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sybok...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.94,0:52:34.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,你必须投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.03,0:52:39.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.08,0:52:46.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,除非你杀了我  杀了他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must kill me. Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.43,0:53:01.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,有一会儿...我以为你真的会这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a moment... I thought you might actually do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.11,0:53:10.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,把他和柯克舰长一起关进牢房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put him in the brig with Captain Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.62,0:53:22.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克  你愿意和我一起去舰桥吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, you will accompany me to the bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.63,0:53:27.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,不...我不愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...l will not.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.89,0:53:32.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I'm right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.10,0:53:41.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么你得跟他们一起去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you must join them.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.26,0:54:06.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,这两个会有用处的  让我们单独待一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These two will be useful. Give us a moment alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.68,0:54:09.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,别害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.37,0:54:30.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋  史波克  你背叛了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it, Spock. You betrayed us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.05,0:54:34.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,我并不期望你原谅我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not expect you to forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.26,0:54:37.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,我真应该狠揍一下你的屁股  如果你认为有用就随便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ought to knock you on your ass. If you think it would help.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.14,0:54:42.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要我把住他吗?  别插嘴...为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to hold him? Stay out of this... Why?.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.31,0:54:46.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,你只需要扣一下扳机  那么赛波克就死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you had to do was pull the trigger. Then Sybok would be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.19,0:54:50.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,我命令你保护飞船  并且杀死我的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ordered you to defend your ship. And kill my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.90,0:54:55.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是你的瓦肯伙伴并不等于他就是...  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fellow Vulcan is not a...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.66,0:54:58.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,赛波克也是萨瑞克之子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sybok also is a son of Sarek.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.29,0:55:02.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,他真是你兄弟?  你瞎编\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's your brother brother?. You made that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.96,0:55:08.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,我没瞎编  你没有兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not. You don't have a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.34,0:55:12.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,严格说来我没有兄弟  看到了吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Technically I don't have a brother. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.76,0:55:18.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我有个同父异母的兄弟  我得坐坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a half-brother. I've got to sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.23,0:55:24.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,你和赛波克的父亲是同一个  但母亲不同?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and Sybok have the same father but different mothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.65,0:55:31.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,赛波克的母亲是个瓦肯公主  但我们像亲兄弟那样长大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Syboky mother was a Vulcan princess, but we were raised as brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.08,0:55:38.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你以前没告诉过我们?  这是私事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you tell us this before? It is a personal matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.09,0:55:43.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,对此我表示道歉  这样就能全部了结了  就一个道歉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For that I am sorry. That makes everything all right. Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.10,0:55:48.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克不能杀他兄弟  就像不能杀你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock could no more kill his own brother than he could kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.31,0:55:50.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,他已经关进牢房里来了  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's already in the brig.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.74,0:55:54.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,再说了  我们还有更重要的事要解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, we've got bigger problems to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.44,0:55:57.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,比如我们怎么从这儿出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like how do we get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.57,0:56:01.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,我得说  你总是令我感到惊奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll say one thing, you never cease to amaze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.28,0:56:03.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,我自己也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nor I myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.13,0:56:16.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,我刚开始担心了  没关系  赛波克会解释的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was beginning to worry. It's all right. Sybok will explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.60,0:56:20.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?  设定新航线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? Plotting our new course.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.81,0:56:23.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,你没权这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.69,0:56:30.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么了?  帕维尔  听他说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on here? Pavel, listen to this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.95,0:56:36.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白  每个人心中都隐藏着一种神秘的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand. Each of us hides a secret pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.33,0:56:41.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我分享你的痛苦  你将从中获得力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Share yours with me and gain strength from the sharing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.81,0:57:00.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.37,0:57:08.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,不明智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.00,0:57:21.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,你应该警告我的  肯定有办法出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could have warned me. There's got to be a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.43,0:57:26.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,这个新牢房能有效防止逃脱  你怎么知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This new brig is escape-proof. How do you know?.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.43,0:57:31.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,设计师们找了最聪明的人来试着逃脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The designers tested it using the most intelligent person they could find.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.98,0:57:36.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,他失败了  这个人是不是长着尖耳朵的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He failed to escape. Did this person have pointed ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.99,0:57:41.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,并且总能够把他的同伴们拖入麻烦之中?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And an unerring capacity for getting his shipmates into trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.91,0:57:46.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,他确实长着尖耳朵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did have pointed ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.71,0:57:57.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,沿新航线前进  曲速7  以当前速度6.7小时内到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Following new course. Warp 7. Arrival in 6.7 hours at present speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.06,0:58:02.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,既然我们已经出发了  我现在向船上  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that we're underway,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.93,0:58:04.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,余下的船员宣布我此行的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll announce my intentions to the rest of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.86,0:58:12.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,进取号星舰上勇敢的船员们  想想存在的问题吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brave crew ofthe starship Enterprise, consider the questions ofexistence.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.45,0:58:15.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是自人类第一次凝望星空 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Questions that man has asked
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.68,0:58:19.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,自梦想诞生以来就已提出的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} since he first gazed at the stars and dreamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.67,0:58:23.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的瓦肯祖先们受他们的情感所支配\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Vulcan ancestors were ruled by their emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.80,0:58:26.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们用心去感受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They felt with their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.88,0:58:32.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们用心去爱  他们用心去信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They made love with their hearts. They believed with their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.31,0:58:39.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,而且他们相信有一个能解答这些问题的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they believed in a place where these questions would be answered.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.61,0:58:44.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,现代信条告诉我们这地方是虚构的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Modern dogma tells us this place is a myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.36,0:58:48.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,是由异教徒编造出来的幻想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fantasy concocted by pagans.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.62,0:58:51.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,这不是幻想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Itis no fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.17,0:58:57.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉你们...这地方真的存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you...it exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.05,0:59:01.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟们  我们被选中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brothers, we have been chosen
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.01,0:59:07.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,去进行有史以来最伟大的冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to undertake the greatest adventure of all time.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.52,0:59:10.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,去探索沙·卡·里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The discovery of Sha Ka Ree.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.36,0:59:16.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,他为了寻找沙·卡·里而离开瓦肯  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it possible he's found Sha Ka Ree,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.28,0:59:18.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,他有没有可能找到它了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the reason he left Vulcan?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.07,0:59:23.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的目的地是沙·卡·里星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our destination is the planet Sha Ka Ree.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.66,0:59:27.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,它存在于大屏障之后...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It lies beyond the Great Barrier...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.38,0:59:30.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,...在银河系的中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..at the centre ofthe galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.55,0:59:35.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,在银河系的中心?  传说中它所存在的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The centre of the galaxy?. Where it is fabled to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.39,0:59:40.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有哪艘飞船能到达银河系中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The centre of the galaxy can't be reached by any ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.81,0:59:43.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,赛波克是我所知道的最有智慧的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sybok possessed the keenest intellect I've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.23,0:59:48.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,等我夺回飞船  把赛波克关到这儿...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I get the ship back, and Sybok is in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.95,0:59:53.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,你再慢慢和他争论沙·卡·里  直到脸上发绿都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can debate Sha Ka Ree until you're green in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.78,0:59:56.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要么站在我这边要么别站我这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're either with me or you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.25,1:00:01.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里  舰长  说得有点含糊  史波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am here, Captain. That's a little vague, Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.80,1:00:06.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么声音?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that noise?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.18,1:00:13.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是一种叫摩尔斯电码的通讯形式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a primitive form of communication known as Morse Code.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.27,1:00:17.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,你说得对  我很久没接触过这个了  这是S\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. I'm out of practice. That's an S.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.36,1:00:20.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,T...  A...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}T... A...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.78,1:00:23.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,N...  D...  单词结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}N... D... End of word.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.82,1:00:25.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,Stand  新词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand. New word.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.07,1:00:28.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,B...  A...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B... A...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.25,1:00:33.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,C...  K...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}C... K...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.46,1:00:36.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,靠后站!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back. Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.39,1:00:45.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们干嘛站在边上?  这是在越狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you standing around for?. This is a jailbreak.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.43,1:00:51.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,这三个人很坚定  真是个挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These three are strong. This will be quite a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.11,1:00:55.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们得找到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to find them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.61,1:00:58.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们谁也不能信  我们可以发送求救信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't trust anyone. Send a distress signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.03,1:01:03.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,观察室里有一台紧急发送机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is an emergency send apparatus in the observation room.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.08,1:01:09.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们可以通过3号涡轮管道到达那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might be able to reach it by means of Turbo-shaft 3.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.42,1:01:13.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,爬上去要很久  而且很危险  某些人就是爱这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long and dangerous climb. Some of us get off on that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.13,1:01:17.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,修好传送机并联络救援飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the transporter working and contact a rescue ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.02,1:01:23.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,去涡轮管道走哪条路?  沿那条通道走然后右转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which way to the Turbo-shaft? Down that tunnel and turn right.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.44,1:01:26.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,你一定会找到的  史考特先生  你真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't miss it. Mr Scott, you're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.82,1:01:30.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我对这艘飞船了如指掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this ship like the back of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.54,1:01:45.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以好好锻炼下了  对  或者患个心脏病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll get a good workout. Yeah, or a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.62,1:02:09.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,快把史考特先生送去医务室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Mr Scott to sick bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.11,1:02:39.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,好像一辈子都爬不完这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is going to take me forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.08,1:02:47.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Spock?.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.38,1:02:53.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我相信我找到了更快的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe I've found a faster way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.40,1:03:10.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,老骨头?  我等下一辆车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bones? I'll wait for the next car.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.41,1:03:13.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们绝不分开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not splitting up.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.67,1:03:23.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们太重了  肯定是吃了太多的沼泽甜瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're too heavy. It must be the marsh melons.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.55,1:03:29.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克  助推器  我无法控制能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, the booster rockets. I can't control their power.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.89,1:03:32.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,启动助推器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire the rockets.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.27,1:03:36.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长  请下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, please come back down.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.03,1:03:41.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,按下控制器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit the brakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.08,1:03:53.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,我飞高了一层  没有人是完美的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I overshot the mark by one level. Nobody's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.72,1:04:05.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.89,1:04:10.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,紧急频道开启\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emergency channel open.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.36,1:04:15.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,通信范围内的任何人  我是詹姆斯T.柯克舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To anyone within range, this is Captain James T Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.40,1:04:18.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,收到请回复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you read me, acknowledge.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.16,1:04:21.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,回复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Acknowledge.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.87,1:04:26.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,这里是星际舰队指挥部  收到讯息  完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Starfleet Command, we readyou. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.54,1:04:32.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,一伙敌意分子控制了我们的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hostile force has taken control of our vessel.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.01,1:04:40.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的方位是000.2  请求紧急援助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our co-ordinates are 000.2. Request emergency assistance.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.35,1:04:44.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,明白  进取号  我们立即派遣一艘救援飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood, Enterprise. We are dispatching a rescue ship immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.98,1:04:49.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,设定航线000.2\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plot course 000.2.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.49,1:04:54.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,但这样的话我们也会驶向大屏障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Captain, that course will take us into the Barrier as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.79,1:04:57.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克去哪  我们就去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where Kirk goes, we follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.09,1:05:06.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,相信你们的讯息已经被收到了  你别指望我们不会采取行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust your message was received. You can't expect us to stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.80,1:05:10.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,你对未知感到恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you fear is the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.89,1:05:16.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们星球上的人曾相信他们的世界是平的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people of your planet once believed their world was flat.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.69,1:05:20.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,哥伦布证明了它是圆的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Columbus proved it was round.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.36,1:05:25.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们曾说音障不可能被打破  它被打破了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said the sound barrier could never be broken. It was broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.83,1:05:29.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们曾说曲速不可能达到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said warp speed could not be achieved.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.17,1:05:37.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,大屏障是这种普遍恐惧的终极表现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Great Barrier is the ultimate expression of this universal fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.26,1:05:40.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是个人恐惧感的延伸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is an extension of personal fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.26,1:05:44.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克舰长  我是多么希望你能理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Kirk, I so much want your understanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.43,1:05:48.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想要你尊重我  你害怕听我把话说完?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want your respect. Are you afraid to hear me out?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.19,1:05:54.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都不怕  在外面等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid of nothing. Wait outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.08,1:06:04.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我能肯定你有许多问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you have many questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.96,1:06:09.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,来  在我们银河的群星之中...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, amidst the stars of our own galaxy,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.34,1:06:13.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我们共同探索答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we shall seek the answers together.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.27,1:06:25.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,放松  史考提  你没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, Scotty. You're back with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.07,1:06:31.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,我梦见一个疯子占领了进取号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dreamt that a madman had taken over the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.87,1:06:35.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,他不是疯子  不是?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not a madman. He's not?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.58,1:06:41.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,赛波克让我们接触到了我们一直害怕表达的那些情感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sybok has put us in touch with feelings we've always been afraid to express.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.01,1:06:46.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,我得去修传送机了  史考提!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to get to the transporter. Scotty!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.55,1:06:53.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我有太多事要对你说  等我稍微好些再说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's so much I want to tell you. Wait till I'm a wee bit stronger.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.52,1:07:00.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得以我目前的情况无法理解关于他的...或你的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think I could take it in my present condition...or yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.99,1:07:05.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,沙·卡·里  源头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sha Ka Ree. The Source.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.12,1:07:08.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,天堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.91,1:07:13.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊甸园  随你怎么称呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eden. Call it what you will.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.54,1:07:16.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,克林贡人叫它奎突\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Klingons call it Qui Tu.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.55,1:07:22.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗幕兰人叫它沃塔·沃  安多利人的叫法难以发音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Romulans, Vorta Vor. In Andorian it is unpronounceable.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.60,1:07:25.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是  每一个文明都分享着这个共同点梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still, every culture shares this common dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.60,1:07:31.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,那里是万物的源泉  对我们来说它很快就会变为现实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A place from which creation sprang. For us it will soon be reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.69,1:07:35.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,我唯一的现实就是我成了自己飞船上的囚犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My only reality is that I'm a prisoner on my own ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.66,1:07:39.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,你用什么能力控制船员的思想的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this power you have to control the minds of my crew?.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.16,1:07:44.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,我并不控制思想...我是释放思想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't control minds... I free them.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.67,1:07:48.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么释放?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How?.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.76,1:07:55.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,让你面对你内心的痛苦并从中获得力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By making you face your pain and draw strength from it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.93,1:07:59.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,一旦完成了  你就不会再恐惧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once that's done, fear cannot stop you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.69,1:08:09.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,听上去就像洗脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It sounds like brainwashing to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.20,1:08:13.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是所有人中最痛苦的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your pain is the deepest of all.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.37,1:08:16.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,我能感觉到  你呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can feel it, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.37,1:08:19.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗纳德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.89,1:08:31.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,这肯定是某种诡计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is some kind of trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.39,1:08:35.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗纳德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.69,1:08:43.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,父亲?  上帝啊!  别对我这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father?. My God! Don't do this to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.24,1:08:45.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗纳德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.38,1:09:00.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在这儿  我就在你身边  父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here. I'm with you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.43,1:09:05.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,痛苦  结束我这种痛苦吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pain. Stop the pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.85,1:09:11.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,我已经尽力了  你得撑住啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've done everything I can do. You've got to hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.15,1:09:15.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,我受不了这种痛苦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't stand the pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.28,1:09:17.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.20,1:09:22.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,我竭尽全力还是救不了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All my knowledge and I can't save him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.04,1:09:28.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,你已经尽力而为了  生命维持系统能让他活下去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done all you can. The support system will keep him alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.30,1:09:35.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,你把这叫活下去?  儿子...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call this alive? Son...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.52,1:09:41.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我解脱吧  我不能那么做  父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release me. I can't do that, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.82,1:09:48.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,但我怎么忍心看他这样受苦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how can I watch him suffer like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.45,1:09:51.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是个医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.50,1:10:01.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是他儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm his son.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.46,1:11:07.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么这么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.72,1:11:15.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,维持他的尊严\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To preserve his dignity.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.44,1:11:23.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,那还不是最糟的  对吗?  对!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wasn't the worst of it, was it? No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.36,1:11:25.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么分享最糟的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Share it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.53,1:11:29.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,不久以后  他们发现一种疗法  一种该死的疗法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not long after, they found a cure. A goddamn cure.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.24,1:11:34.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不杀他  他就还能活着  我让他解脱了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you didn't kill him, he'd have lived. I released him!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.66,1:11:38.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,你做了你以为是正确的事  是的!  不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did what you thought was right. Yes! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.42,1:11:41.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,从痛苦中解脱吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release this pain!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.17,1:11:46.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,这种痛苦长久以来毒害着你的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This pain has poisoned your soul for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.39,1:11:52.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在你迈出了第一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you've taken the first step.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.31,1:11:55.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我们一起走完剩下的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other steps we'll take together.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.28,1:12:05.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,每个人的痛苦都是独特的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each man's pain is unique.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.66,1:12:08.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我没有什么隐藏的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hide no pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.75,1:12:15.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,我比你以为的更了解你  是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you better than that. Do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.63,1:12:18.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克  别  没关系  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, don't. It's all right, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.43,1:12:22.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proceed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.69,1:12:31.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么?  我相信我们正在目睹我的出生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this? I believe we are witnessing my birth.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.86,1:13:11.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,萨瑞克  你的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarek, your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.04,1:13:16.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,真像人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So human.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.80,1:13:23.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock?.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.03,1:13:47.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,你对我的朋友做了些什么?  没什么  他们就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done to my friends? Nothing. This is who they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.46,1:13:52.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道?  对  我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't you know that? No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.38,1:13:55.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在了解一下你自己吧  不  我不干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now learn something about yourself. No, I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.13,1:14:00.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,吉姆  试着对这个开明一点  对哪个?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim, try to be open about this. About what?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.81,1:14:06.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在人生中怎么作了错误的决定?  怎么走错了人生道路?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How I made wrong choices in my life? Turning left instead of right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.86,1:14:11.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要赛波克带着我游览自己的虚弱之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need Sybok to take me on a tour of my weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.44,1:14:15.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是在被骗子洗脑!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be brainwashed by a conman!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.49,1:14:21.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,这个骗子去除了我的痛苦  仅仅魔杖一挥就去除了痛苦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This conman took away my pain. With the wave of a magic wand?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.21,1:14:25.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们所经历过的事造就了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The things we carry with us make us who we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.09,1:14:29.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们失去了这些  我们就迷失了自我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we lose them, we lose ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.47,1:14:32.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不想去掉我的痛苦  我需要这些痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want my pain taken away. I need my pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.39,1:14:39.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长  你继续待在这儿 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, you remain here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.58,1:14:42.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克  麦考依医生  跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, Dr McCoy, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.40,1:14:48.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克?  我不能跟你走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock?. I cannot go with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.45,1:14:52.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?  我属于这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not? I belong here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.66,1:14:56.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白  赛波克...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand. Sybok...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.50,1:14:59.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的兄弟  但你并不了解我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are my brother, but you do not know me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.80,1:15:03.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不是你多年前丢下的那个被遗弃的小男孩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not the outcast boy you left behind many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.68,1:15:10.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我找回了自我和自己的位置  我知道我是什么样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found myself and my place, and I know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.48,1:15:13.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不能跟你走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot go with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.95,1:15:22.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,你最好也别叫我跟你走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd better count me out, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.95,1:15:28.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么我只好在大屏障另一边跟你们再见了  等等!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'll see you on the other side. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.84,1:15:33.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们不可能成功穿越大屏障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll never make it through the Great Barrier.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.01,1:15:37.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果成功了  能使你相信我的观点是正确的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we do, will that convince you that my vision was true?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.39,1:15:44.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,是上帝在指使我  他在大屏障另一边等着我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was given to me by God. He waits for us on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.23,1:15:49.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.61,1:15:55.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am l?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.45,1:15:58.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们走着瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.24,1:16:27.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们说没有飞船能够幸存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say no ship can survive this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.36,1:16:30.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们错了  危险是一种假象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're wrong. Danger is an illusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.24,1:16:33.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的仪表全都没读数了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have no instrument readings.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.75,1:16:38.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,苏鲁先生  全速前进  全速前进  明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Sulu, full ahead. Full ahead, aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.41,1:17:40.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么可能?  太神奇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it possible? Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.67,1:17:45.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们在做梦吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.38,1:17:52.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果是的  那么人生就是一场梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we are, then life is a dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.10,1:18:00.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,(大胆踏迹前人未至之地)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.50,1:18:22.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,仪表重新恢复了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instruments are back on line.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.38,1:18:24.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,不可思议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.39,1:18:30.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,这个星球发出一种我从没见过的能源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a power source emanating from the planet like nothing I've seen.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.44,1:18:38.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,沙·卡·里  奎突\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sha Ka Ree. Qui Tu.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.74,1:18:41.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,沃塔·沃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vorta Vor.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.87,1:18:44.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,伊甸园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eden.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.01,1:18:59.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,关于这艘飞船...  它需要舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About the ship... The ship needs its captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.14,1:19:03.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有特殊条件?  没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No special conditions? No conditions.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.31,1:19:08.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,那我也许会让飞船调头回去 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could turn us around.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.61,1:19:11.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,不  你太需要去了解这一切了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you too must know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.20,1:19:19.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,那  既然我们一定要这么做  就按着本本办事好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if we're going to do it, we're going to do it by the book.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.62,1:19:26.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,标准轨道靠近  准备好穿梭机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Standard orbital approach. Alert the shuttlecraft to stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.42,1:19:28.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,赛波克  史波克  麦考依 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sybok, Spock, McCoy,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.44,1:19:30.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来  其余人留在飞船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}come with me. The rest of you remain on board.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.72,1:19:33.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,等我先搞清楚我们在跟什么打交道再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until I determine what we're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.81,1:19:39.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,别傻站着了  上帝可是个大忙人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't just stand there, God's a busy man.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.33,1:20:31.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,穿梭机不受我控制了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am no longer in control of the craft.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.26,1:21:11.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  我们全听你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we'll play it your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.80,1:21:48.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,真迷人  这大地  这天空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's amazing. The land. The sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.48,1:21:51.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,就像我心目中的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just as I knew it would be.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.08,1:22:40.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,史考提  你看看这个  我没时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to see this. I don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.00,1:22:45.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长要我修好传送机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Captain told me to get the transporter working.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.08,1:24:22.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们乘坐星舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have travelled far.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.63,1:24:28.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,远道而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By starship.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.06,1:24:40.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,进取号  我是柯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enterprise, this is Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.07,1:24:44.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.75,1:24:56.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,赛波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sybok.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.01,1:25:02.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,也许...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.43,1:27:23.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎  勇敢的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brave souls, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.53,1:27:32.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是上帝的声音吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this the voice of God?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.41,1:27:37.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,一种声音  多张面庞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One voice, many faces.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.18,1:27:52.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,是否这样更合乎你的期望?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this better suit your expectations?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.12,1:28:11.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁?  我就是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Qualse tu? It is l.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.96,1:28:16.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们的旅程一定很不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yourjourney could not have been an easy one.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.67,1:28:20.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的  我们必须突破大屏障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was not. We had to breach the Barrier.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.34,1:28:26.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,了不起  你们是最先找到我的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magnificent. You are the first to find me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.98,1:28:33.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们来向你寻求无限的智慧  你们是怎么突破屏障的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We sought only your infinite wisdom. How did you breach the Barrier?.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.86,1:28:38.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,乘坐星舰  这艘星舰...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a starship. This starship...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.74,1:28:44.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,它能否将我的智慧带出屏障?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could it carry my wisdom beyond the Barrier?.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.25,1:28:48.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,是的  能够  那么我要用它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could, yes. Then I shall make use of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.71,1:28:52.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,它将成为您的马车  打扰一下...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be your chariot. Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.88,1:28:59.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,我将游遍宇宙的每个角落  我想问个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will reach every corner of creation. I'd like to ask a question.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.89,1:29:07.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,上帝要星舰干什么?  把这艘星舰驶近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does God need with a starship? Bring the ship closer.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.40,1:29:12.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,上帝要星舰干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does God need with a starship?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.45,1:29:15.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?  问问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? Asking a question.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.91,1:29:21.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,这个生物是谁?  你不知道?  你不是上帝吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this creature? Don't you know?. Aren't you God?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.84,1:29:27.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,他有他的疑惑  你怀疑我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has his doubts. You doubt me?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.51,1:29:33.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想要证明  你不能向全能的上帝要他的ID\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I seek proof. You don't ask the Almighty for his ID.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.52,1:29:36.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,那么这就是你想要的证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then here is the proof you seek.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.54,1:29:53.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,上帝为什么生气?  你为什么这么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is God angry?. Why have you done this?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.88,1:29:57.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,他怀疑我  你还没回答他的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doubts me. You have not answered his question.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.01,1:30:00.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,上帝要星舰干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does God need with a starship?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.90,1:30:12.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,你也怀疑我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you doubt me?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.45,1:30:20.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,我怀疑所有那些将自己的快乐 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I doubt any god
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.68,1:30:23.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,建立在别人的痛苦之上的上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who inflicts pain for his own pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.16,1:30:28.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,住手!  沙·卡·里上帝是不会这么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! The god of Sha Ka Ree would not do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.38,1:30:34.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,沙·卡·里?  那是你自己创造的幻想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sha Ka Ree? A vision you created.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.93,1:30:42.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,长久以来我一直被囚禁在此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An eternity I've been imprisoned in this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.02,1:30:48.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,飞船  我一定要得到飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship. I must have the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.95,1:30:53.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在...给我飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...give me what I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.99,1:30:55.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,赛波克...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sybok...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.12,1:31:00.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,这不是沙·卡·里上帝  或其他任何上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not the god of Sha Ka Ree, or any other god.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.09,1:31:04.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不明白  让我看看你的真面目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand. Reveal yourself to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.39,1:31:16.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么?  难道你不喜欢这张脸?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong? Don't you like this face?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.61,1:31:21.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,我有那么多样子  这个最适合你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have so many, but this one suits you best.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.57,1:31:25.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,不  这不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.74,1:31:30.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,给我飞船  否则我就消灭你们  飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring me the ship or I will destroy you. The ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.54,1:31:38.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,把它驶近点...这样我就能与它结合了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring it closer so that I might join with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.13,1:31:46.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,照做  否则就看着这些微不足道的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it, or watch these puny things
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.06,1:31:49.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,悲惨地死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}die horribly.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.86,1:31:57.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,我做了什么?  进取号  仔细听好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have I done? Enterprise, listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.87,1:32:02.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我的所作所为  是我的傲慢  自负\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my doing. This is my arrogance. My vanity.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.87,1:32:06.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,赛波克  我们必须想办法...  不  你们逃命吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sybok, we must find a way... No, save yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.42,1:32:09.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,原谅我  兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.97,1:32:17.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,我虽然不能帮助  但注意到了你的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't help but notice your pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.93,1:32:20.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的痛苦很深重  与我分享吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It runs deep. Share it with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.11,1:32:28.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,进取号  准备好了吗?  鱼雷已装载\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enterprise, are you ready?. Torpedo armed.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.11,1:32:33.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们将向你们所在的位置发射  发射!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're firing on your position. Send it down now!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.38,1:32:44.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,快跑!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.57,1:33:02.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,赛波克...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sybok...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.96,1:33:12.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们快离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.63,1:33:17.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,苏鲁  我失去他们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sulu, I've lost them.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.96,1:33:46.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克  带我们离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock, get us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.43,1:34:00.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,推进器失灵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thrusters are inoperative.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.91,1:34:19.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,史考特先生  请告诉我传送机已经修好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Scott, please tell me the transporter is working.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.09,1:34:22.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,我现在可以传送两个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might be able to beam up two of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.17,1:34:28.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,把史波克和麦考依医生传送上去  该死的等等!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beam up Spock and Dr McCoy now. Just a damn minute!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.81,1:34:35.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,把舰长带上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring up the Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.64,1:35:05.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能把吉姆留在那里  关心你自己就行了  报告情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't just leave Jim down there. Get a grip on yourself. Status report.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.68,1:35:09.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,克林贡舰长想谈谈条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Klingon captain wishes to name his terms.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.82,1:35:13.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是克林贡帝国的克拉舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Captain Klaa ofthe Klingon Empire.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.11,1:35:19.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要企图装载武器  否则我就摧毁你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not attempt to arm your weapons orl will destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.54,1:35:23.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们现在还活着只是因为一个原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are alive for a single reason:
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.46,1:35:26.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,叛逆者詹姆斯T.柯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The renegade James TKirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.25,1:35:30.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,把他交出来我就饶了你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hand him over and I will spare your lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.47,1:35:35.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我已经准备好把他传送上舰了  柯克舰长不在我们这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ready to beam him aboard. Captain Kirk is not among us.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.68,1:35:40.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,你撒谎  瓦肯人不撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lie. Vulcans are incapable of lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.98,1:35:45.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,柯克舰长在下面的星球上  那么给我他的坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Kirk is on the planet below. Then give me his co-ordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.36,1:35:55.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助  我的帮助?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am in need of your assistance. My assistance?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.46,1:36:00.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是他的上司  我是个笨老头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are his superior officer. I am a foolish old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.29,1:36:03.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,见你的鬼  先生  你一定要试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn you, sir. You will try.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.64,1:36:13.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,克林贡指挥官  有人想和你说几句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Klingon commander, someone wishes to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.87,1:37:07.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们这帮混蛋要抓的是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it's me you want, you bastards.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.30,1:37:09.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们还等什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you waiting for?.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.62,1:37:37.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,放了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release him.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.42,1:37:42.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的部下有话要跟你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Myjunior officer has something he wants to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.55,1:37:50.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,我...向你道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...apologise.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.82,1:38:03.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,对你们飞船的攻击没有得到我们政府的批准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The attack upon your vessel was not authorised by my government.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.87,1:38:11.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在  请允许我介绍我们的新炮手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, may I present our new gunner.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.18,1:38:26.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克!  欢迎登舰  舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock! Welcome aboard, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.99,1:38:36.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I was going to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.78,1:38:40.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,不可能  你从不孤独\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not possible, you were never alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.59,1:38:50.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,舰长  请不要在克林贡人面前这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Captain, not in front of the Klingons.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.91,1:39:14.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,想不想呷一点点苏格兰威士忌?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you care for a wee nip of Scotch whisky?.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.83,1:39:18.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,我从没想过自己会和一个克林贡人一起喝酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never thought I'd be drinking with a Klingon.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.21,1:39:26.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩在密谋什么呢?  关于我们所取得的进展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you two conspiring about? About the progress we've made.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.39,1:39:34.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,她的肌肉真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has wonderful muscles.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.17,1:39:54.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,在思考宇宙吗  先生们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cosmic thoughts, gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.46,1:39:59.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们在思索...真有上帝在那儿吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were speculating... Is God really out there?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.26,1:40:05.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,也许他不在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he's not out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.48,1:40:09.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,也许他在这儿  在人们心中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he's right here in the human heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.07,1:40:18.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,史波克?  我在想赛波克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spock?. I was thinking of Sybok.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.91,1:40:23.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,我失去了一个兄弟  嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have lost a brother. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.79,1:40:28.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经失去一位兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost a brother, once.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.68,1:40:33.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很幸运  我把他带了回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was lucky. I got him back.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.26,1:40:38.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,我记得你说过像我们这样的人没有家庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you said men like us don't have families.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.44,1:40:45.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,我错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.30,1:41:09.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,你只是要拨弄那东西呢  还是准备弹奏点什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you just going to pluck that thing, or are you going to play something?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.02,1:41:19.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,划呀划  来划船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Row, row, row your boat
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.32,1:41:23.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,缓缓地顺流而下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Gently down the stream
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.32,1:41:26.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,欢快地  欢快地  欢快地  欢快地划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Merrily, merrily, merrily, merrily
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.50,1:41:29.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,生命是梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Life is but a dream...
